              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, yĩla mevuva mbya sya ndũũme ĩvuva yĩasa, na yĩla mwĩw’a wasya wa soo, andũ onthe nĩmakokĩlye mawasya mũno mũnene; na ũvai wa ndũa ũkavalũka mbu, na andũ makambata kĩla mũndũ aeleele kuma vala eĩĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosua mwana wa Nuni eeta athembi, na amea, Ukĩlyai ĩsandũkũ ya ũtianĩo, na athembi mũonza nĩmakue masoo mũonza ma mbya sya ndũũme me mbee wa yĩla ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mamea andũ, Vĩtai, mũthyũlũlũke ĩla ndũa, na ala andũ mekĩĩte mĩio ya kaũ nĩmavĩte mbee wa yĩla ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla Yosua waĩ ananeena na andũ, ala athembi mũonza makuĩte masoo mũonza ma mbya sya ndũũme me mbee wa Yeova maenda mbee, na mavuva masoo: na ĩsandũkũ ya ũtianĩo ya Yeova yamaatĩĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ala andũ mekĩĩte mĩio ya kaũ maenda mbee wa athembi ala mavuvaa masoo, na ala ma ĩtina maatĩĩa yĩla ĩsandũkũ, athembi makĩvuva masoo maendete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosua ameaĩa andũ, akĩmea, Mũtikokĩlye mawasya, o na mawasya menyu matikew’ĩke, o na ndeto o na yĩva ndĩkaume makanyw’anĩ menyu, kũvika mũthenya ũla nĩmwĩaĩa mũkĩlye mawasya: nĩvo ĩndĩ mwĩũkĩlya mawasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ atuma ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova yĩthyũlũlũkw’a ndũa, ĩthyũlũlũka yĩmwe: na masyoka mwakonĩ wa maeema, na makoma mwakonĩ wa maeema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosua ookĩla kĩoko tene na ala athembi mookĩlya yĩla ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na athembi mũonza ala makuĩte masoo mũonza ma mbya sya ndũũme me mbee wa ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova maendeeaa matekũũngama, na makĩvuva masoo: na ala andũ mekĩĩte mĩio ya kaũ mamatongoesya; na ala ma ĩtina maatĩĩa yĩla ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova, athembi makĩvuva masoo maendete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthenya wa kelĩ mathyũlũlũka ndũa ĩmwe, na masyoka mwakonĩ wa maeema: meekie o ta ũu mĩthenya thanthatũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mũthenya wa mũonza, mookĩla tene w’oa ũitema, na mathyũlũlũka ndũa o ta ũu mathyũlũlũka mũonza: ate o mũthenya ũsu mathyũlũlũkile ndũa mathyũlũlũka mũonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa ĩthyũlũlũka ya mũonza, yĩla athembi mavuvaa masoo, Yosua amea andũ, Usyai ngemi; nũndũ Yeova nũmũnengete ndũa ĩno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ndũa ĩkeethĩwa ĩvathĩtwe kwa Yeova, o yo na syonthe ĩla syĩ nthĩnĩ: ate o Laavi yĩla ĩlwaya wĩekwa e thayũ, we na onthe ala me nake nyũmbanĩ, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwavithie atũmwa ala twatũmie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
