              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ Yosua amaeka me thayũ Laavi yĩla ĩlwaya, na andũ ma nyũmba ya ĩthe wake, na syonthe ila waĩ nasyo; nake atũaa katĩ wa Isilaeli kũvika ũmũnthĩ, nĩkwĩthĩwa avithie atũmwa, ala Yosua watũmie mathiane Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
